{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CfryqjvqLZ8fCLHFbko3T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`contacts.dedupe` now matches the accented, Mac/Windows, and ß/ss variants, and `tests/test_dedupe.py` passes (1 passed, previously failing).\n\n**Root causes**, all in `name_key` in `contacts/dedupe.py`:\n\n1. **Incomplete accent table.** The hand-written list had no `ú`, `ç`, `ø` and similar letters, so \"Núñez\" never matched \"Nunez\". This is the failure the existing test reproduced.\n2. **Mac vs. Windows Unicode forms.** The table only matched precomposed characters (Windows style). macOS often stores \"é\" as `e` + combining acute (NFD), so the lookup missed it.\n3. **ß vs. ss.** `.lower()` leaves \"ß\" alone, while `casefold()` maps it to \"ss\".\n\n**Fix:** `name_key` now applies NFKD normalization, drops combining marks, then casefolds and collapses whitespace. This covers every accent, both Unicode forms, and ß. I added a module-level `import unicodedata`, as your CLAUDE.md asks.\n\nI checked these directly: NFD and NFC forms of \"José Núñez\" give the same key, \"Große Straße\" matches \"GROSSE STRASSE\", and a non-breaking space between name parts matches a normal space. Survivors are still the first-seen record. Only `contacts/dedupe.py` changed; I didn't touch the test. Running pytest rewrote a tracked `.pyc` file, so I restored it with `git checkout`. Nothing is committed.\n\n**Not addressed:** `dedupe` doesn't index the keys of records it drops. So if B duplicates A by email, and C matches B by name but not A, C survives. The reported symptoms didn't involve this, so I left it alone. Say if you want transitive merging."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3506,"cache_read_input_tokens":42671,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3506},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d3124f8a-45bb-46e7-a9f3-9d558c4fcbe1","uuid":"ea7bba31-3e94-4331-8292-e40b54aa9d06","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:29:59.998Z","request_id":"req_011CfryqjfiSanpvhc6HoYdR"}
